  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land and Titling Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Titulacin de Tierras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TTHE PROJECT WILL FINACE THE ACTIVITIES LEADING TO TITLE AND REGISTER THE LLANDS OWNED BY THE STATE AS A RESULT OF THE AGRARIAN REFORM(300000 TITLES);THE ACTIVITIES BEFORE THE REGISTER FOR THE SMALL AND MEDIAN PRODUCERS, TO REGULARIZE THE SITUATION OF ABOUT 300.000 ADITIONALS PLOTS; THE MMODERNIZATION OF THE RURAL CADASTRO AND THE EQUIPMENTS FOR 42 OFFICES OF THE PPUBLIC REGISTER IN THE RURAL SECTOR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
